# Build context hygiene.
#
# `.env` is the important line. Vite inlines VITE_* variables at build time, so
# a local `.env` holding VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000 inside the build
# context would hard-code localhost into the production bundle and the deployed
# site would call the visitor's own machine for its API.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
dist/
.vite/

npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

.git/
.gitignore
*.md
